  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="Allplan">
      <data key="d0">Allplan</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan is a software application designed specifically for architecture and engineering, providing a comprehensive suite of tools for building design, project management, and document handling. It is particularly noted for its user-friendly graphical user interface that enhances user interaction with the program's features. The interface includes essential components such as the Title Bar, Working Area, Quick Access Toolbar, and Actionbar, which facilitate efficient navigation and tool accessibility.

Allplan is equipped with functionalities that support configuration management, including Actionbar settings and customization options that allow users to tailor their workspace according to their needs. The software emphasizes collaborative workflows and interoperability, making it an essential resource for architecture and construction professionals who need effective tools for managing projects.

The application supports various processes related to project creation and document sharing, with a strong focus on fostering user experience through well-defined navigation tools and guidance for installation and basic functionalities. Allplan's capabilities extend to providing updates, configurations, and support resources, vital for effective project management in the design and construction sectors.

Several versions of Allplan exist, including Allplan 2020, signifying its ongoing development to meet the evolving needs of architects and engineers. Overall, Allplan serves as a robust platform for architectural design and project management, combining essential tools for task execution, user interface customization, and collaborative project workflows.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-37b7974294d5dbe5374084c4f9b64f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85968547f406814fe01a792a6bfad6ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5608eabba91468e79e0b7513b3f8fe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675201b298a763511e37a89783d5683e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cdda7897c878c62cb62f9da2fb8c2c35&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c791a1b4e64cec7090f31ce864634f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2fcd61668b340d5f5f5ea9e212a69da6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634f6d9a0019159fdc220f6c4cb60b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3198c15b67b032c729ef5bbf14947122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fba02831111786f4844d59eb31063fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8926136792774f7e465cb7c7d96749c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db8930be6e804689e4241167765f8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b47139e9f3599e58d34b6ab8a824e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8de519ba2ae07158b2c212b2adb0801f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f43814ab53ef67655b2ab9a8b56c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1f890f48e17539051c44240fb5dfc7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca630d152b6add4ff1b7527872026871&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196fa705ca21ee9b6eb371370bb51040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc81fc6dae5447a6cabd4ace2db97e72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a24a6623760fabfeeb2c6acba22309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-015d54e4dd4f5cecfa706d157674f135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01072fd631c1a72e396b3f8fe494d688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2673b69d81c68fb688841bf367f94da2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78dac9e5dbc5e89911fd3b9babcfb8ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d95ed498b051f9e4864ef5cd6a63fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3fc6cef4ad479487074f3087ba424eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e652ad366d2674837a2bc159d9581772&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1155fe3b177be620d9d8df67101692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2111659b4ebdb64d0ab1d33c8eb0ef3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf1b394546ded0304254c7c25047c8ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e729d190d6d3f5aeafe60768a83887c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee3832b1b352a6acc30dc24c43daa21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f55cb0505caf1ceab61370b6798d2f76&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0393fd9d9be09f1fa5e61692a4e20c9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbce64443888bc24b03524d2a30b8ca7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68f359c440ba20f24c098c181c5ddd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2f75c26ab5f94647cdfe6bc46e4435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7f071477aeea641643403d40788115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-28f8f0c9202d3e91030a95d2a3f23149&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d320987986508a9133ce0f38be8a938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b64a8b672b3b