    <node id="Welcome Screen">
      <data key="d0">Welcome Screen</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Welcome Screen is a feature of the Allplan software that combines frequently used tools for new users.&lt;SEP&gt;The Welcome Screen is mentioned as a specific tool related to the user interface of Allplan, intended to assist users in navigating the software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Welcome Screen is a feature within Allplan designed to facilitate user engagement and navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Welcome Screen is an introductory element in the Allplan user interface documentation that guides users towards accessing features such as creating and opening projects.&lt;SEP&gt;The Welcome screen is a feature of Allplan software that allows users to customize their interaction with the software upon launching.</data>
