    <node id="Bimplus">
      <data key="d0">Bimplus</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Bimplus is an openBIM platform developed by Allplan for exchanging all building data across disciplines.&lt;SEP&gt;Bimplus is a tool associated with Allplan, aiding in project management and building information modeling (BIM).</data>
