    <node id="Default Configurations">
      <data key="d0">Default Configurations</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Default Configurations in Allplan determine the initial settings and menus visible to users when they first install the software.&lt;SEP&gt;Default Configurations in Allplan refer to preset layouts for the user interface that can be selected by the user.</data>
