    <node id="Working Area">
      <data key="d0">Working Area</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">The Working Area refers to the main section of the Allplan window where users can arrange and interact with various controls.&lt;SEP&gt;Working area is a part of the user interface that allows users to perform tasks and manipulate elements in the Allplan software.&lt;SEP&gt;The Working Area refers to the section within Allplan software where configurations and user interface elements are displayed and interacted with.&lt;SEP&gt;The Working Area is another interface configuration element relevant to Allplan documentation.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-37b7974294d5dbe5374084c4f9b64f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c791a1b4e64cec7090f31ce864634f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14a515a9996fb626facc5bb10382b271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db8930be6e804689e4241167765f8b5</data>
