    <node id="Actionbar">
      <data key="d0">Actionbar</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Actionbar is a crucial user interface component within the Allplan software, designed to enhance user navigation and interaction with various tools and features. It consists of organized sets of tools grouped into task areas, which are structured according to roles, tasks, and additional context-specific configurations. This organization promotes efficient access to necessary tools for users engaged in design and workflow processes.

Functionally, the Actionbar serves as a taskbar that includes labeled sections for different tools, enabling users to rapidly find and utilize the functions they need. It is integral to the overall navigational framework of Allplan, facilitating user interaction and customization within the software environment. The Actionbar is presented as a horizontal strip, allowing for a clear layout of icons and labels that represent various functionalities.

In the context of Allplan’s user interface, the Actionbar is not only essential for tool access but also contributes to the customization options available to the user, enhancing their overall experience. Each user can tailor the Actionbar according to their specific needs, making it a significantly versatile component in software configuration. 

Overall, the Actionbar is a foundational aspect of Allplan software’s design, serving multiple roles in organizing tools and promoting effective task management for users engaged in building design and architectural projects. Its integral role in user interaction emphasizes its importance within the software's interface structure.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-37b7974294d5dbe5374084c4f9b64f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5608eabba91468e79e0b7513b3f8fe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675201b298a763511e37a89783d5683e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c791a1b4e64cec7090f31ce864634f78&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa0859d3a6d44cf74e5f6f8a4880242d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1b6c4fd748890ec91aa1589adc5b643&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fba02831111786f4844d59eb31063fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db8930be6e804689e4241167765f8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-289ca2abd53093ce090878475bc9ef97&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b74e9c31d20b3568963b35cd0c96d24b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46f43814ab53ef67655b2ab9a8b56c45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a34f5df7135757e2e22029decc1f5944&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca630d152b6add4ff1b7527872026871&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196fa705ca21ee9b6eb371370bb51040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc81fc6dae5447a6cabd4ace2db97e72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e45a39966e48f34f889a6abb474f2af9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b62eb63f6a5adf32ba0243792bc05164&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a24a6623760fabfeeb2c6acba22309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a469d19549f0709d53e8d995f1a9811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43df3b3fbde5acd57989a0271296cb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9939c677c8509e04213029daddd606e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee3832b1b352a6acc30dc24c43daa21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f3ceecaab2b77abfe1b67cc9277e3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c68f359c440ba20f24c098c181c5ddd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7f071477aeea641643403d40788115&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2d0c84baeeb92aadf44515ebf6e23597&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-674d65da423af0c559625ddef5140f7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d320987986508a9133ce0f38be8a938&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19e8454cbb8273e97dfda3202f32dbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f9739999e6b00cb0a5d9e3626b81cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1fdad9718ac5f025436308d367ea85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f57616d6a66a90e6dc2fa124da2a6d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ae32f00f8435e306f3cecec61bbc6bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1f0f43283aa2b4324aae59549dbf7b3</data>
