    <node id="Palettes">
      <data key="d0">Palettes</data>
      <data key="d1">component</data>
      <data key="d2">Palettes in Allplan are user interface elements that can be docked to the working area for easy access to tools and options.&lt;SEP&gt;Palettes are another component in Allplan's user interface that assists in the arrangement of various controls.</data>
