    <node id="Actionbar Configurator">
      <data key="d0">Actionbar Configurator</data>
      <data key="d1">method</data>
      <data key="d2">Actionbar Configurator is a tool used for setting and managing roles within the Allplan environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configurator is a tool enabling users to customize, export, and import Actionbar configurations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configurator is a tool panel within Allplan that allows users to configure task areas and roles in a digital workspace.&lt;SEP&gt;Actionbar Configurator refers to functionalities concerning the configuration and interaction with the Actionbar features.&lt;SEP&gt;Actionbar Configurator is a tool or feature related to user customization, which requires certain installation guidelines and prerequisites.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configurator is a tool documented for customization, role creation, and management features in a particular application context.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configurator is a tool within Allplan that provides detailed instructions for users to customize their Actionbar.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-85968547f406814fe01a792a6bfad6ed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675201b298a763511e37a89783d5683e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34e68a9eff4ae1eeba021193147a2bb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a24a6623760fabfeeb2c6acba22309a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0162b554d2e6e227d0f941b962aea96c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61688479b1f8b514b9c8258a684616d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbce64443888bc24b03524d2a30b8ca7</data>
