      <data key="d1">interfaceelement</data>
      <data key="d2">The Manage Roles Tab is a feature within the Actionbar Configuration dialog box that allows for the export and import of roles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Manage Roles Tab is a part of the Actionbar Configuration Tool where users can manage and assign roles.</data>
