    <node id="Quick Access Toolbar">
      <data key="d0">Quick Access Toolbar</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">The Quick Access Toolbar is a customizable interface feature in Allplan, a software application used primarily for architectural design. It is designed to enhance user accessibility and streamline application navigation by allowing users to arrange and access their frequently used tools and commands efficiently. This feature includes essential tools such as 'New Project', 'Open Project', and 'Save', which facilitate user interactions within the software.

As part of the interface configuration in Allplan, the Quick Access Toolbar provides a user-friendly component that organizes essential tools for architectural design tasks. Users can customize this toolbar to suit their workflow, enabling quicker access to commonly used functions and improving overall productivity. The Quick Access Toolbar essentially serves as a vital element in Allplan's user interface, aimed at providing an efficient means for users to utilize various tools and functionalities tailored to their specific needs.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-5608eabba91468e79e0b7513b3f8fe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14a515a9996fb626facc5bb10382b271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-634f6d9a0019159fdc220f6c4cb60b09&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db8930be6e804689e4241167765f8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b47139e9f3599e58d34b6ab8a824e7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e1f890f48e17539051c44240fb5dfc7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca630d152b6add4ff1b7527872026871&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196fa705ca21ee9b6eb371370bb51040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3936a20e46d6eba16350bd29edfe7ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4eec6a3dddd44021fc0a9b0dc66b59e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-015d54e4dd4f5cecfa706d157674f135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01072fd631c1a72e396b3f8fe494d688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2673b69d81c68fb688841bf367f94da2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d95ed498b051f9e4864ef5cd6a63fbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2efde186e4cfca1add896c7d25f302d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3fc6cef4ad479487074f3087ba424eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e652ad366d2674837a2bc159d9581772</data>
