    <node id="Allplan 2020">
      <data key="d0">Allplan 2020</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Allplan 2020 is a specific version of the Allplan software designed primarily for architectural design and project management. It incorporates a user interface suitable for CAD applications, allowing architects and project managers to create detailed floor plans and utilize various design tools. The software is discussed in relation to its interface configurations, including elements such as the Quick Access Toolbar and menus that facilitate user interactions.

Allplan 2020 serves as a version reference that helps users understand the functionalities and compatibility of this particular iteration of the Allplan software. While it is noted in documentation, some descriptions indicate that there is a lack of detailed context regarding its specific features and capabilities. This absence of information renders certain references to Allplan 2020 somewhat redundant in analyses that seek to elaborate on the software's comprehensive functionalities.

In summary, Allplan 2020 is noted both as a version designation and a software application that includes architectural tools accessed through an interface dubbed the Actionbar. However, some references classify it as discarded content, highlighting a need for more substantial information to enrich understanding of its specific features and functionalities.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b1b6c4fd748890ec91aa1589adc5b643&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14a515a9996fb626facc5bb10382b271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e75f41d6e6ac17de521ed44a0db4773d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc81fc6dae5447a6cabd4ace2db97e72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-015d54e4dd4f5cecfa706d157674f135&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1155fe3b177be620d9d8df67101692e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7a469d19549f0709d53e8d995f1a9811&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43df3b3fbde5acd57989a0271296cb59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d128293255b7a4ce92fcf450cc400ee6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a2f75c26ab5f94647cdfe6bc46e4435&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d320987986508a9133ce0f38be8a938</data>
