    <edge source="Allplan" target="Actionbar">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Actionbar is a key interface component of the Allplan software, specifically designed to optimize user interaction and streamline various tasks associated with building design. It organizes tools and features across different design roles, ensuring users can easily navigate the software's functionalities.

As an integral element of Allplan's user interface, the Actionbar not only enhances overall accessibility but also serves as a crucial navigation tool. Users can configure the Actionbar to fit their individual needs, which aids in improving their workflow within the software. By facilitating user navigation and operation, the Actionbar plays a significant role in the efficiency and effectiveness of the design process in Allplan.

In summary, the Actionbar functions as a vital part of Allplan's toolsets, promoting an organized approach to tasks and enhancing the user experience through its structured layout and customizable features.</data>
      <data key="d9">interface element,navigation,navigation tool,software feature,software tool,tool integration,user interface,user interface element</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-37b7974294d5dbe5374084c4f9b64f02&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5608eabba91468e79e0b7513b3f8fe70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-675201b298a763511e37a89783d5683e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9fba02831111786f4844d59eb31063fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6db8930be6e804689e4241167765f8b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196fa705ca21ee9b6eb371370bb51040&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eee3832b1b352a6acc30dc24c43daa21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d7f071477aeea641643403d40788115</data>
      <data key="d11">Allplan_2020_Manual_half.pdf</data>
