    </edge>
    <edge source="Allplan" target="Actionbar Configurator">
      <data key="d7">2.0</data>
      <data key="d8">Allplan utilizes the Actionbar Configurator for managing tool configurations and roles.&lt;SEP&gt;The Actionbar Configurator serves as a tool within Allplan, enhancing its software application's configurability.</data>
