    <edge source="Allplan" target="Quick Access Toolbar">
      <data key="d7">10.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The Quick Access Toolbar is an essential feature of Allplan software, designed to enhance user interaction and accessibility to frequently used tools. This component allows users to customize their interface by organizing and quickly accessing vital functionalities. 

Incorporated into Allplan's interface configurations, the Quick Access Toolbar serves as a user-friendly element, enabling efficient navigation through the software's tools. By providing easy access to essential features, the Quick Access Toolbar significantly improves the overall functionality of Allplan, making it an indispensable part of the software environment.

Overall, the Quick Access Toolbar not only enhances the user experience but also contributes to a more streamlined workflow within Allplan, ensuring that users can work more effectively by readily accessing the tools they need.</data>
